{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261116/photo/bkn-20261116033043345-1116_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261116094011\"/><p>屯門發生酒駕交通意外。今日(16日)凌晨零時31分，有駕車人士報案，指田景路往鳴琴路方向近田景邨田樂樓對出位置，有一輛輕型貨車發生交通意外，撞毀約兩米長欄杆。</p><p>人員接報到場，發現涉事男司機未有受傷，惟身上有酒氣。經初步調查後，未能通過酒精呼氣測試。姓劉(41歲)司機涉嫌「酒後駕駛」被捕，現正被扣留調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T01:50:18.238147+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":160,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T19:30:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T09:29:12.772005+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T01:43:56.948401+00:00","content_hash":"f9bbd17de5ac6383ad90028deeee4d53bb3c81027e291a6371dca39bbe832c14","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}